    "description": "A youth series with a point of view, in the way of filming, in the real stories that the fiction is based on, in the choice of natural locations that are filmed entirely. Another proposal for television, another challenge. Life, they say, is like skateboarding. You are alone and you try to balance. It is OK to fall, as long as you can get up afterwards. A group, Petros, Spike, Nikos and Christos, cross the city. Young people, faced with the everyday life of their age. Faced with dilemmas and decisions that will determine their future. Between adolescence and maturity. Dozens of routes, in the suburbs, in the city center, on the streets. Where real stories are written.",
